{
 "id": "seg6",
 "title": "真客服吗",
 "pill": 6,
 "total": 67.6,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg6-00",
   "text": "交易所今天就能做一件事。",
   "spoken": "交易所今天就能做一件事。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg6-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 2.616,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 3.388
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-01",
   "text": "查一查，客服后台有多少人，能查到一条完整的用户记录。",
   "spoken": "查一查，客服后台有多少人，能查到一条完整的用户记录。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg6-01.mp3",
   "start": 4.436,
   "dur": 5.568,
   "speechStart": 4.534,
   "speechEnd": 9.165
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-02",
   "text": "普通用户也有几件事。",
   "spoken": "普通用户也有几件事。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg6-02.mp3",
   "start": 10.224,
   "dur": 2.64,
   "speechStart": 10.322,
   "speechEnd": 12.024
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-03",
   "text": "买硬件钱包用代收地址，交易所和电商用不同的邮箱。",
   "spoken": "买硬件钱包用代收地址，交易所和电商用不同的邮箱。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg6-03.mp3",
   "start": 13.084,
   "dur": 5.52,
   "speechStart": 13.182,
   "speechEnd": 17.753
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-04",
   "text": "不在社交媒体上，把自己的地址或 ENS 名称，和真实身份连在一起。",
   "spoken": "不在社交媒体上，把自己的地址或 ENS 名称，和真实身份连在一起。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg6-04.mp3",
   "start": 18.824,
   "dur": 6.048,
   "speechStart": 18.922,
   "speechEnd": 24.041
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-05",
   "text": "收到交易所的泄露通知，开启提币白名单，至少几个月保持警惕。",
   "spoken": "收到交易所的泄漏通知，开启提币白名单，至少几个月保持警惕。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg6-05.mp3",
   "start": 25.092,
   "dur": 5.64,
   "speechStart": 25.19,
   "speechEnd": 29.88
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-06",
   "text": "回到开头的题。",
   "spoken": "回到开头的题。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg6-06.mp3",
   "start": 30.952,
   "dur": 2.16,
   "speechStart": 31.05,
   "speechEnd": 32.276
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-07",
   "text": "对方说得出你的名字、余额和工单，不代表他是真客服。",
   "spoken": "对方说得出你的名字、余额和工单，不代表他是真客服。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg6-07.mp3",
   "start": 33.332,
   "dur": 5.16,
   "speechStart": 33.43,
   "speechEnd": 37.656
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-08",
   "text": "这些数据，可能早就泄露了。",
   "spoken": "这些数据，可能早就泄漏了。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg6-08.mp3",
   "start": 38.712,
   "dur": 3.144,
   "speechStart": 38.81,
   "speechEnd": 41.024
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-09",
   "text": "交易所和钱包厂商，永远不会让你把资产转到安全地址，也不会索要助记词。",
   "spoken": "交易所和钱包厂商，永远不会让你把资产转到安全地址，也不会索要助记词。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg6-09.mp3",
   "start": 42.076,
   "dur": 6.936,
   "speechStart": 42.174,
   "speechEnd": 48.174
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-10",
   "text": "主动打来的电话、短信、邮件，说你的账户有风险，一律挂断，再从官方 App 里联系客服。",
   "spoken": "主动打来的电话、短信、邮件，说你的账户有风险，一律挂断，再从官方 App 里联系客服。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg6-10.mp3",
   "start": 49.232,
   "dur": 8.088,
   "speechStart": 49.33,
   "speechEnd": 56.472
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-11",
   "text": "数据里没有密码，可它告诉骗子，该骗谁，该怎么说。",
   "spoken": "数据里没有密码，可它告诉骗子，该骗谁，该怎么说。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg6-11.mp3",
   "start": 57.54,
   "dur": 5.16,
   "speechStart": 57.638,
   "speechEnd": 61.876
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-12",
   "text": "下一集讲资金追踪与事后处置。",
